事故时应在服务平台进行理赔流程的申请，提交真实修人身份信息及需要的资料，经审核资料通过后，由服务平台推送就近维修服务地点；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2.如本地无维修网点或无官方授权售后时可能需要您寄至指定地点维修。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">七、旧件的回收:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">维修换下的手机旧零件属于服务方，服务中心进行回收处理。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>设备型号:</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><u> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </u></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>设备IMEI:</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><u> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </u></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>签字确认:</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><u> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </u></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><strong>日期:</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><u> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </u></span></p><p><br></p>','iPhone17pro256G','357034524725957','2026-06-29','/profile/upload/2026/06/29/tmp_2be12ae8f1ae9fedfc62385415a6e6a5_20260629152601A196.png'),(22,182,1,'','<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 168.65pt;\"><strong>全心宝保障服务条款</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">感谢您购买全心宝保障服务，我们将竭力为您提供优质、满意的服务，请您仔细阅读本服务条款，该服务条款描述了您能够获得的保障及利益，在您购买本服务之前，请全面阅读并仔细审核服务中的所有内容。您的购买付费行为将被视为您同意本服务条款。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">一、商品名称：全心宝保障服务</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">二、商品